    "location": "The scheme will be located near the town centre where there is easy access to shops, medical facilities, recreational facilities,  various school (both National and Secondary) and childcare facilities along with  3rd level education (Maynooth university). Maynooth Business campus along with Carton Retail Park provide employment opportunities locally. \n\nThe scheme is on the edge of Maynooth town adjacent to the M4 motorway which bypasses the town connecting the town with Dublin and the west - Athlone, Galway & Sligo. Maynooth is also on the Dublin-Sligo railway line and is served by InterCity train services (connecting Maynooth to Dublin city and suburbs) The train station is located approx. 850 meters from the estate. The town is also serviced by Bus Eireann which connects the town with various towns / cities throughout the country."
