  "description": "All homes are A rated and highly energy efficient. The properties are semifurnished, giving tenants the flexibility to personalise their homes to their own taste.\n\nEach home includes white goods, including a fridge freezer, a dishwasher, an oven and hob, a microwave and washer/dryer as standard. \n\nAdditional features include roller blinds throughout—with blackout blinds in all bedrooms—as well as flooring and  tiled bathrooms.\n\nPlease note that parking is very limited within the development and will not be available for most residents. \n\nIf you are interested in one of these properties and would like to find out more information and how to apply, please visit our website https://www.cluid.ie/COST-RENTAL",
